  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Life &amp; Peace Institute&#xb4;s Conflict Transformation  Programme 2013-2016 - Life &amp; Peace Institute&#xb4;s Conflict Transformation</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Liv &amp; Fredsinstitutets Konfliktomvandlingsprogram 2013-2016</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">LPI&apos;s overall objective is outlined in their vision of success: Conflict in the programme areas transformed, with narratives that drive conflict in Somalia demystified and deconstructed locally and internationally.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen avser st&#xf6;d &#xe5;r 2013 -2016 till Liv- och Freds institutets     Konfliktomvandlingsprogram (CTP). M&#xe5;ls&#xe4;ttningen f&#xf6;r programmet &#xe4;r att bidra till varaktig fred, s&#xe4;kerhet och utveckling i Stora             sj&#xf6;-regionen och Afrikas horn-regionen.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objectives of the LPI Conflict Transformation Programme           (2013-2016) contributes towards the achievement of sustainable peace, security and development in the Great Lakes and Horn of Africa        regions.</narrative>
  </description>
